{"id":"ku_rzlich","lemma":"kürzlich","pos":"adv","rank":2182,"glosses":["recently, lately (in the recent past)"],"ipa":"/ˈkʏʁtslɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a8/De-k%C3%BCrzlich.ogg/De-k%C3%BCrzlich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Das ist kürzlich erst passiert.","en":"It happened just the other day.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566874","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"first, at first"},{"g":"to happen","l":"passieren"}]},{"text":"Haben Sie sich kürzlich übergeben?","en":"Have you been sick recently?","words":[{"g":"have"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"oneself"},null,{"g":"to hand over"}]},{"text":"Ich habe kürzlich meine Kamera verloren.","en":"I lost my camera the other day.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"camera"},{"g":"lost, missing"}]},{"text":"Sie sind kürzlich hierher gezogen.","en":"They moved here recently.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"to here, here , hither"},{"g":"to pull","l":"ziehen"}]},{"text":"Mein Vater hat kürzlich das Rauchen aufgegeben.","en":"My father has given up smoking recently.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"father"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to smoke"},{"g":"abandoned"}]}]}